{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dragon Conqueror&quot;   is an RPG game produced by BanameiR  and published by Hanabi games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396400/extras/c6b840cb94b9d56ea2255f15c13c6d80.avif?t=1766821558\" width=550 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dragons are long gone. The Dragon Hunt Frenzy made sure of it. But Rayleigh, the disciple of the Sword Saint, is still trapped in the past. Memories of the whole village getting turned into stone, Black Dragon, and Pied Piper come to haunt her every night... She tried to find out what really happened since then, but to no avail. One day, she finds an article about a sighting of The Black Dragon. Anxious, yet excited she rushed out of her home to embark on a journey to discover the truth. It's a journey of fateful encounters, evil schemes, but most importantly a journey of facing her past and her true self.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396400/extras/a4edc0d9b51604c9499fd14b0e50a6f9.avif?t=1766821558\" width=550 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396400/extras/f5611da286d33326515daa2cb05c048e.avif?t=1766821558\" width=550 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396400/extras/27c6037773f283926055eaafdec3b8d1.avif?t=1766821558\" width=550 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam